From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode <opencode@localhost>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: phoenix: add multimedia q6asm DAI

The q6asm DAI driver expects a child node for each enabled frontend.  The
missing Multimedia1 node makes q6asm-dai probe fail with -EINVAL before the
sound card can be registered.

Based on the corresponding SM7150 mainline surya device tree.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
index 1..2 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7150-xiaomi-phoenix.dts
@@ -90,1 +90,8 @@
+&q6asmdai {
+	/* Declare the frontend used by the Phoenix multimedia sound card. */
+	dai@0 {
+		reg = <MSM_FRONTEND_DAI_MULTIMEDIA1>;
+	};
+};
+
 &ipa {
